rvation cancellation + continued scanning after an unexpected admission failure, and that max schedule count handling still works.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 2 out of 2 changed files in this pull request and generated 1 comment.\n\n| File | Description |\n| ---- | ----------- |\n| `nvflare/app_common/job_schedulers/job_scheduler.py` | Adds safe cleanup/abort semantics around resource admission failures and improves exception handling granularity. |\n| `tests/unit_test/app_common/job_schedulers/job_scheduler_test.py` | Adds regression tests ensuring unexpected admission errors cancel reservations, record history, and honor retry limits. |\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/NVIDIA/NVFlare/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pull/5191#pullrequestreview-5013165053","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pulls/5191","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pull/5191#pullrequestreview-5013165053"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pulls/5191"}},"submitted_at":"2026-08-24T22:26:40Z","commit_id":"c48e72448e17d7e9dcb4d12b849f010015367f9e"},{"id":5013238861,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOFy3KIc8AAAABKs_0TQ","user":{"login":"YuanTingHsieh","id":13113932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTEzOTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13113932?u=cd1d2e28b74b87ffd45367d2c7e16c490ef4c07c&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YuanTingHsieh","html_u